# Project Architecture

VibeOS is an AI-native SDLC platform organized as a monorepo.

## Directory Layout

| Path | Role | Language |
|------|------|----------|
| `apps/web` | React/Vite SPA | TypeScript |
| `agents/*-agent` | Per-domain AI agents | Python |
| `agents/shared/vibeos_agent` | Shared agent SDK (protocol, tools, config) | Python |
| `services/workspace-svc` | Workspace/task/GitLab REST API | Go |
| `services/ws-gateway` | WebSocket real-time relay (Redis Pub/Sub) | Go |
| `services/shared/models` | Shared Go DTOs & response types | Go |
| `platform/llm-gateway` | Multi-provider LLM routing proxy | Python |
| `platform/memory-service` | Mem0 memory (project/org/preference) + Qdrant | Python |
| `platform/rag-pipeline` | LlamaIndex RAG indexing & retrieval | Python |
| `platform/knowledge-service` | Knowledge graph (AGE) + LLM distillation | Python |
| `deploy` | SQL init, migrations, docker-compose | SQL/YAML |

