## Vite Proxy Rules

- `/api/nlp`, `/api/workflow`, `/api/agents` → port 8040 (pm-agent)
- All other `/api/*` → port 8010 (workspace-svc)
- `/ws` → ws://localhost:8020

## API Response Envelope

All Go services wrap responses in `models.APIResponse[T]`:

```go
type APIResponse[T any] struct {
    Data  T      `json:"data"`
    Error string `json:"error,omitempty"`
}
```

Frontend `unwrap()` in `lib/api.ts` expects this shape.

## WebSocket Event Types

Go constants in `services/shared/models/api.go`:

```
agent:status    agent:message    agent:log
activity        chat_message     task_update
phase_update    notification
```

Python workflow events (prefixed `workflow:`):

```
workflow:project_start    workflow:phase_start
workflow:phase_complete   workflow:phase_skip
workflow:task_start       workflow:task_complete
workflow:task_error       workflow:project_complete
workflow:project_error
```

## Go Module References

Services use `module github.com/vibeos/<service>` with `replace github.com/vibeos/shared => ../shared` for local dev. Import shared types as `github.com/vibeos/shared/models`.

## Python Package Structure

All Python packages use **hatchling** build system, **Python >= 3.12**. Domain agents depend on the `vibeos-agent` distribution from `agents/shared/`. Use `vibeos_agent.*` imports for shared code.
